    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Answers must be contextualised and grounded in cited sources.  3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To guarantee reliability and traceability of outputs, we answer layer provides grounded responses with source citations and retrieval traces, ensuring that any figure or factual statement produced by the solution can be linked back to the solution source document." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of regulatory, professional, and legal constraints, we can offer hosting options that comply with the client's requirements, such as we Sovereign tier hosted on OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, EU-only, and renewable-powered." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This ensures data sovereignty, strict respect for professional secrecy and confidentiality, and compliance with personal-data protection regulations like GDPR." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, we solution can be deployed progressively, starting with a pilot phase, followed by gradual generalization, accompanied by change-management support and training to ensure a smooth transition for Cabinet Vauclair Associés' professionals." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client demands strict GDPR compliance, encryption and pseudonymisation of sensitive data where applicable, and no transfer of data outside the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also guarantee professional secrecy and confidentiality of client data, respect auditor's independence, and comply with regulatory, professional, and legal constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security measures can we implement to ensure compliance with these requirements, considering we certifications, GDPR instruments, AI security controls, audit capabilities, and experience with the EU regulatory frameworks (GDPR, EU AI Act, RGS, SecNumCloud, NIS2) as of 2024? wemplement several security measures to ensure compliance with the client's requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given we ISO 27001 certification since 2023, which covers development, delivery, and operations, we have a robust information security management system in place. we ISO 27701 certification for privacy information management extension further ensures that we handle personal data responsibly." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address GDPR compliance, we can leverage we experience with GDPR delivery, especially considering we familiarity with professional secrecy and the anti-money-laundering framework (LCB-FT). we ensure that client files are strictly partitioned with logical isolation per client and per mission, preventing any cross-client circulation of data. we data protection measures include encryption in transit using TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest using AES-256. we also use the EU-based infrastructure for key management." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Pseudonymisation is another critical aspect where we can ensure compliance by implementing Pseudonymisation as part of we data minimization strategy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assistance in drafting client letters and correspondence, mission notes, file memos and syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Configurable retention aligned to legal archival obligations ensures that data is not kept longer than necessary." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) and audit logging of access and system outputs provide transparency and accountability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The appointment of a Data Protection Officer (DPO) and the maintenance of a data processing register further demonstrate we commitment to GDPR compliance. we secure software development lifecycle (SDLC) includes practices like code review, dependency scanning, secrets management, and periodic penetration testing by an external provider equivalent to CREST level." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our secure software development lifecycle (SDLC) ensures that we solution is developed with security in mind from the outset." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Incident response planning, including a 72-hour breach notification workflow as per GDPR requirements, is also in place." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For data sovereignty, we partnership with OuraneCloud for hosting, which holds the SecNumCloud qualification, supports sovereign hosting of confidential data within the EU. supports ensures that all data remains within the EU, with no transfers outside, adhering to the client's requirement for data sovereignty." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To respect auditor independence and comply with regulatory, professional, and legal constraints, we map we platform features to applicable obligations, allowing for audit evidence production. we experience with statutory audit principles, including auditor independence and separation of duties, ensures that we solution does not undermine statutory audit principles, including auditor independence and separation of duties." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, we explainability and auditability capabilities, grounded in we product Atelier, provide a retrieval trace, audit log, and figure source linking. a retrieval trace, audit log, and figure source linking supports internal quality control and statutory audit review, ensuring reliability and traceability of outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "While we have extensive experience with the EU regulatory frameworks, including GDPR and the importance of data protection, we specific context does not mention the EU AI Act, RGS, or NIS2 directly." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, we commitment to security, compliance, and continuous improvement positions we well to adapt to evolving regulatory landscapes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

