    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of regulatory compliance, Cabinet Vauclair Associés' maintain Cabinet Vauclair Associés' security and compliance posture through a dedicated function, focusing on professional-services deployment contexts. a dedicated function, focusing on professional-services deployment contexts includes monitoring obligations such as GDPR (including Article 28 processing agreements), professional secrecy, anti-money laundering frameworks, auditor independence rules, and emerging EU AI Act requirements." ;
