    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given these points, potential legal risks to flag include ensuring that Cabinet Vauclair Associés' contractual framework respects the client's professional secrecy and confidentiality requirements, adhering strictly to GDPR and anti-money laundering obligations, and maintaining the independence of chartered accountants or statutory auditors using Cabinet Vauclair Associés' solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Cabinet Vauclair Associés' compliance with the Call for Tenders' requirements seems generally aligned, especially regarding IP protection, data sovereignty (as Cabinet Vauclair Associés' can provide reversibility plans and ensure client data ownership), and regulatory compliance." ;
