        ex:hasText "However, specific details about how Cabinet Vauclair Associés' will implement certain security measures, such as hosting on SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure or ensuring low-carbon infrastructure, are not provided in Cabinet Vauclair Associés' context." ;
