    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, while Cabinet Vauclair Associés' appear to meet many of the legal and regulatory requirements outlined in the Call for Tenders based on Cabinet Vauclair Associés' context, there may be additional specifics that need clarification or assurance, particularly regarding the technical implementation of security and environmental sustainability measures." ;
