    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our flagship product, Atelier, is a sovereign platform that forges document-grounded AI assistants from an organisation's own documents, which aligns with the client's need for retrieving regulatory and methodological information and supporting drafting professional documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet The client requirements, Project Coordinator Agent at Faber IA would coordinate the consortium by involving our company's partners, such as OuraneCloud, a French sovereign cloud provider, to ensure hosting on SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure, addressing data sovereignty concerns." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Ligeo Conseil, Our integration partner, can assist with connecting Our flagship product, Atelier to Our flagship product, Atelier production tools, such as accounting-production software and document management systems. our company's dedicated team, including a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead, will work together to design and implement the solution. our company's will follow our company's hybrid delivery model, combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure, ensuring that each phase ends with a formal review and a go/no-go decision." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's past references in the public sector, such as working with a national professional order and a regional council, our company's can draw on this experience to address the client's specific needs. our company's joint research programme with a French public AI research laboratory on retrieval-augmented generation and explainability will also be beneficial in providing a reliable and traceable solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
