    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on the provided context, I can propose a technical architecture that leverages we existing technology stack to meet The client requirements. we can design a solution around we Atelier platform, which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform.  our Atelier platform, which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform will provide the core functionality for information consultation assistance, drafting assistance, and client-file handling support. our Atelier platform, which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform components, such as the document-ingestion pipeline, vector store, retrieval layer, orchestration layer, and answer layer, will enable quick access to reliable and up-to-date information, grounded in cited sources." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To integrate with Cabinet Vauclair Associés' production tools (accounting production software, payroll software, document management GED), we can utilize we API design capabilities, which follow an API-first approach (REST + webhook), allowing for seamless integration with Cabinet Vauclair Associés' accounting-production software, payroll software, document-management systems (GED), and electronic-invoicing/dematerialisation environment. we business tool integration capabilities, including connectors and adapters developed in partnership with Ligeo Conseil, will facilitate integrate." ;
